{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32418","headline":"自有扈至京师已後朱樱之期 · 温庭筠","name":"自有扈至京师已後朱樱之期","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露圆霞赤数千枝，银笼谁家寄所思。\n秦苑飞禽谙熟早，杜陵游客恨来迟。\n空看翠幄成阴日，不见红珠满树时。\n尽日徘徊浓影下，祗应重作钓鱼期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}